{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnGrA5LDbZ7Eab8rsFph","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My decision is still **approved**. The previous draft was rejected only because of a formatting error, so it was never registered as an approval. This is the same sealed bundle (`rvb-84f1b7779fb959da`, checkpoint df7da2f0) that I reviewed in the last round. The only change is the ID of the current-round finding, which is now the local `F3`; `prior_findings` keeps the round-prefixed IDs. My judgments, evidence, accounting of prior findings and sweep are unchanged. I ran no new commands: Bash was denied in the previous review, and this round is only a format correction.\n\n## Previous-round findings\n- **R1-F1: fixed.** The root-registry result from the final audit now also goes into the primary root's audit (`governance_read_view.go:388-408`). The read-view metadata is built from that audit (`:438-538`), so freshness, limitations and the read-view ID now reflect it. Regression tests at `governance_read_view_d7_probe_test.go:225-375` cover review, closeout and projection in five cases: stable, changed once then stable, persistently changed, conflicting, and over budget.\n- **R1-F2: fixed.** The final audit reuses the immutable captured bytes instead of copying them (`governance_read_view.go:2074-2078`). Callers still get their own copies (`:1423`, `:1508`, `:1522`).\n- **R1-F3: not fixed, accepted as a risk.** The substring match is still at `index_generation_build.go:205`. The spec tracks it as an open follow-up (`.pose/specs/…:409`, owner `@pose-maintainers`, review by 2026-12-06).\n\n## Findings\n- **F3 (low, follow-up):** `pose-mcp/internal/cli/index_generation_build.go:205` still picks the `federated-roadmap` error code by matching a substring of the error text, not a typed error. I'm accepting it as a risk with the owner and date above.\n\n## Structural facts\n- **SD-0cf58a00** (`validation-matrix.json`): caused by R10 and Validation V7. It adds the required race check `governance-read-view-integration` and the explicit `-count=1` checks.\n- **SD-5c5ba300** (ADR): caused by the spec constraint that the B34 ADR must be accepted before the contract changes. It is the basis for decisions D2–D9.\n- **SD-98ca1442** (`delegation.json`): caused by D8. It holds review-agent settings that apply only to this POSE instance and are excluded from the scaffold (`distpolicy.go:118`). It contains no secrets. The narrower session regex fixes the retained capture failure from run `rrn-db41024e48aa50af`.\n\n```pose-draft\n{\n  \"schema\": \"pose.review.draft/v1\",\n  \"decision\": \"approved\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\"id\": \"F3\", \"severity\": \"low\", \"disposition\": \"follow-up\", \"file\": \"pose-mcp/internal/cli/index_generation_build.go\", \"line\": 205, \"summary\": \"Index build failure code 'federated-roadmap' is still selected by substring match on error text instead of a typed/sentinel error; recorded as an owned open follow-up in the spec.\", \"action\": \"Replace the substring classification with a typed error while preserving the code, receipts and negative controls.\", \"owner\": \"@pose-maintainers\", \"review_by\": \"2026-12-06\"}\n  ],\n  \"prior_findings\": [\n    {\"id\": \"R1-F1\", \"status\": \"fixed\", \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view.go:388-408 merges the registry audit into perRoot[op.primary] consumed by metadata (:438-538); regressions pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_d7_probe_test.go:225-375 cover review/closeout/projection with stable/once/changed/conflict/budget; sealed integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration pass\"},\n    {\"id\": \"R1-F2\", \"status\": \"fixed\", \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view.go:2074-2078 shares immutable captured bytes after close/join; caller isolation kept at :1423, :1508, :1522\"},\n    {\"id\": \"R1-F3\", \"status\": \"not-fixed\", \"evidence\": \"pose-mcp/internal/cli/index_generation_build.go:205 unchanged; accepted as owned follow-up in .pose/specs/2026-10-13-pose-governance-read-view-generation.md:409 (owner @pose-maintainers, review 2026-12-06); carried as current finding F3\"}\n  ],\n  \"sweep\": \"Re-read the operation final audit, metadata and per-root audit, readFile/open caller isolation, obligation projection retry/coverage and the reason classifier, review/closeout read-view application and retry, index build capture/retry (governance_read_view_capture.go, index_generation_build.go), write guard and scoped guard, action write scope, the new registry regressions, the delegation.json change and its distpolicy exclusion. Bash (git/go test/pose) was denied in the review session, so mechanical judgments rely on sealed evidence plus source reading. This round only corrects the draft's finding identifier format.\",\n  \"criteria\": [\n    {\"id\": \"assumption-integrity\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:.pose/specs/2026-10-13-pose-governance-read-view-generation.md:409\"},\n    {\"id\": \"backend-concurrency\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"backend-contracts\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/cli-mcp-operation-results-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"backend-input-errors\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/typed-diagnostics-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"backend-integration-impact\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"backend-observability\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\"},\n    {\"id\": \"compatibility\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:POSE.md:372\"},\n    {\"id\": \"correctness\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"cross-component-integration\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/cli-profile-parity-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"design-causality\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view.go:388\"},\n    {\"id\": \"documentation\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:POSE.md:372\"},\n    {\"id\": \"milestone-exit-gate-pose-state-consistency-and-recovery-governance-read-view\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view_d7_probe_test.go:225\"},\n    {\"id\": \"operability\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:pose-mcp/internal/cli/index_generation_build.go:39\"},\n    {\"id\": \"requirements\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"integration:pose-mcp/go/governance-read-view-integration\"},\n    {\"id\": \"scope\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:.pose/specs/2026-10-13-pose-governance-read-view-generation.md\"},\n    {\"id\": \"security\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/distpolicy/distpolicy.go:118\"},\n    {\"id\": \"solution-proportionality\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"file:pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_read_view.go:2075\"}\n  ],\n  \"tools\": [\n    {\"id\": \"artifact-check\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Command execution denied in the review session; no sealed evidence ID for this tool.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"assess-design\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"structure:design-a47effa4f8e59c51\", \"rationale\": \"\"},\n    {\"id\": \"assess-discover\", \"component\": \"pose-mcp\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Recommended; command execution denied; no sealed evidence.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"assess-discover\", \"component\": \"tests\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Recommended; command execution denied; no sealed evidence.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"assess-integrate\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Command execution denied; integration inventory is static and has no sealed evidence ID.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"assess-tech-debt\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Recommended; command execution denied; implementer reports INCOMPLETE (two unreadable historical specs).\"},\n    {\"id\": \"closeout-check\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Command execution denied; no sealed evidence for this tool.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"knowledge-check\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Command execution denied; no sealed evidence for this tool.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"review-check\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Command execution denied; no sealed evidence for this tool.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"suggest-review\", \"component\": \"pose-mcp\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Recommended; command execution denied.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"suggest-review\", \"component\": \"tests\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Recommended; command execution denied.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"surface-check\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Command execution denied; no sealed evidence for this tool.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"validate\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"Sealed evidence covers only pose-mcp module checks; no sealed global validation for this checkpoint (prior global run on b7b5680f is not current).\"},\n    {\"id\": \"validate\", \"component\": \"pose-mcp\", \"disposition\": \"passed\", \"evidence\": \"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\", \"rationale\": \"\"},\n    {\"id\": \"validate\", \"component\": \"tests\", \"disposition\": \"not-used\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"rationale\": \"The tests module declares replaceDefaultChecks with an empty check list (producer coverage none); no sealed evidence exists.\"}\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18970,"cache_read_input_tokens":156851,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18970},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"2169a437-6cd6-40ce-9ac8-86d4c002a090","timestamp":"2026-11-06T20:04:52.847Z","request_id":"req_011CgnGr9iW4bqZ9vnTy4qpk"}
